DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31113::$$$message_0227_0000_0000$$$::As evening falls, I start preparing dinner. I glance outside and see that the sun is already down.[lr]::
31114::$$$message_0227_0000_0001$$$::They say daytimes are short this time of year, so I'd better stay sharp if I want to enjoy the sunset.::
31115::$$$message_0227_0001_0000$$$::"Shirou, I cleaned the bathtub. Where are the unused bath towels?"[lr]::
31116::$$$message_0227_0001_0001$$$::"Ask Saber. It's her job to take in the laundry."[lr]::
31117::$$$message_0227_0001_0002$$$::I answer while beating a rhythm with my kitchen knife.[lr]::
31118::$$$message_0227_0001_0003$$$::I can hear the bustle of multiple people behind me in the living room.::
31119::$$$message_0227_0002_0000$$$::"Senpai, we're out of soy sauce. I'm going to the store to pick some up."[lr]::
31120::$$$message_0227_0002_0001$$$::"It's already late. Just go tomorrow. We can ask Fuji-nee's house to share some with us.[lr]::
31121::$$$message_0227_0002_0002$$$::Illya, can you go with Sakura[line len=2]"::
31122::$$$message_0227_0003_0000$$$::   Oh, Illya's not here.[lr]::
31123::$$$message_0227_0003_0001$$$::She invades the house with Fuji-nee in the morning, but she's often absent in the evening.[lr]::
31124::$$$message_0227_0003_0002$$$::If she does show up, it's usually suddenly after dinner when we're all relaxing.::
31125::$$$message_0227_0004_0000$$$::"I'll go with her. I want to discuss about this morning, as well. It's dangerous to go out alone at night."[lr]::
31126::$$$message_0227_0004_0001$$$::"Saber? Yeah, thanks.[lr]::
31127::$$$message_0227_0004_0002$$$::The men at their house tend to get scared when Rider goes, after all. Don't take too long."[lr]::
31128::$$$message_0227_0004_0003$$$::Saber and Sakura let me know that they heard me.[lr]::
31129::$$$message_0227_0004_0004$$$::They take an empty glass bottle and cheerfully head off to visit the Fujimura Group.::
31130::$$$message_0227_0005_0000$$$::"Shirou, I'm sorry to bother you in the middle of cooking."[lr]::
31131::$$$message_0227_0005_0001$$$::Rider comes in as the other two depart.[lr]::
31132::$$$message_0227_0005_0002$$$::Rider doesn't show up in the living room until 7 o'clock sharp. She reads in her room all day until then.::
31133::$$$message_0227_0006_0000$$$::"What's up?"[lr]::
31134::$$$message_0227_0006_0001$$$::"While you were out, a stranger visited and tried to sell us a tabloid newspaper subscription. I declined, but he wouldn't give up. He seemed eager to visit us every day until we purchase it.[lr]::
31135::$$$message_0227_0006_0002$$$::...To be blunt, may I consider the salesman an enemy?"[lr]::
31136::$$$message_0227_0006_0003$$$::"No. Absolutely not."::
31137::$$$message_0227_0007_0000$$$::Because people would die.[lr]::
31138::$$$message_0227_0007_0001$$$::Be kind to people, and yourself.[lr]::
31139::$$$message_0227_0007_0002$$$::...Rider's a patient person, but she doesn't waste time categorizing people as friends or enemies.[lr]::
31140::$$$message_0227_0007_0003$$$::This person's an enemy. That person's a friend. She's absurdly fast at putting people into those boxes.[lr]::
31141::$$$message_0227_0007_0004$$$::Saber's somewhat like that, though not really.[lr]::
31142::$$$message_0227_0007_0005$$$::Saber's definition of friends and enemies is broad, but once she decides you're on the wrong side, she doesn't hold back.::
31143::$$$message_0227_0008_0000$$$::"...I understand. I'm not confident I can stay polite, but I will try to hear him out tomorrow."[lr]::
31144::$$$message_0227_0008_0001$$$::"You don't have to. If you tell him we already have a newspaper, he won't come back for three months. Either stick with that, or ask Sakura to settle it instantly."::
31145::$$$message_0227_0009_0000$$$::"Sakura? But I would expect her to struggle with such people."[lr]::
31146::$$$message_0227_0009_0001$$$::"One can apparently overcome their struggles. You should see how Sakura shoots down newspaper salesmen. It gives me shivers."::
31147::$$$message_0227_0010_0000$$$::She leads them on into throwing in other subscriptions and add-ons, but then she turns them down at the very end.[lr]::
31148::$$$message_0227_0010_0001$$$::And her smile when she says, "I'll call the police if you don't leave" is too shocking for any man to bear.[lr]::
31149::$$$message_0227_0010_0002$$$::It's an aggressive defense on par with a Kyoto woman offering you bubuzuke to get you out of their hair.::
31150::$$$message_0227_0011_0000$$$::"I see. I can understand that we should avoid making her angry, considering how calm she is every day.[lr]::
31151::$$$message_0227_0011_0001$$$::...By the way, where is she now?"[lr]::
31152::$$$message_0227_0011_0002$$$::"She went with Saber to the Fujimuras. They'll be back soon, so go ahead and watch TV with Fuji-nee."::
31153::$$$message_0227_0012_0000$$$::"Would you like help plating the food?"[lr]::
31154::$$$message_0227_0012_0001$$$::"I'll be fine, but I appreciate the thought. We just need one big plate today."[lr]::
31155::$$$message_0227_0012_0002$$$::Rider gives me a quick bow and heads back to the living room.[wait canskip=0 time=300][clfg textoff=0 pos=all rule=シャッター左から time=400]::
31156::$$$message_0227_0013_0000$$$::"GAAAH!? W-what are you doing, Rider? They were finally showing the legendary Racket Rainbow Gaddem!"[lr]::
31157::$$$message_0227_0013_0001$$$::"I'm sorry. I wanted to watch the news."::
31158::$$$message_0227_0014_0000$$$::"Gwah! Th-that isn't a good reason, even if it's obvious![lr]::
31159::$$$message_0227_0014_0001$$$::Come on, that anime isn't boring, you know![lr]::
31160::$$$message_0227_0014_0002$$$::It's just a Racket, but it uses crazy weapons like floppies, pizzas, and laser cannons. It's on a whole different level that you can't define with 'cool' or 'boring.'"::
31161::$$$message_0227_0015_0000$$$::Rider nods expressionlessly along to Fuji-nee's explanation while watching the news.[lr]::
31162::$$$message_0227_0015_0001$$$::According to her, reading is a key part of her lifestyle, but TV is purely a hobby.::
31163::$$$message_0227_0016_0000$$$::"Still, though..."[lr]::
31164::$$$message_0227_0016_0001$$$::Our house really is lively now.[lr]::
31165::$$$message_0227_0016_0002$$$::Imagine how much noisier it's going to get once we all sit down for dinner.::
931146::$$$message_9227_0009_0001$$$::"One can apparently overcome their struggles. You should see how Sakura shoots down newspaper salesmen. It gives me shivers."[r]::

